apps/sail-site/.bundle-cost/
apps/sail-site/.static-inventory.json
apps/sail-site/.static-crawl.json
apps/sail-site/.static-crawl.md
.archive/

# Internal planning (not product docs)
spike-notes/
docs/ship-sail/

# Eval harness run artifacts (trajectories may contain machine paths)
eval/runs/

# Python bytecode
